notes.notes:
Brothers! Closed beta version is already available for everyone who owns the game!
List of innovations:
improved war logic;
the role of the Lodge of the Brotherhood has been changed;
there appeared game events, including historical events;
new quests implemented.
Please note that the version may not have translations into other languages. There will be a lot of strings in Russian.
To get the beta on Steam, right-click on the game Secret Government, select Properties - Betas and enter the code IWantToBeAPartOfSecretGovernment. Click on the code verification button. You will have the game in the Closed-beta branch. Looking forward to your feedback!
